note as BIZ_diagram_38_erp
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Tenant-level enterprise resource management that complements the per-practice
  accounting subledgers (module 16/16B). Adds the organizational backbone: a general
  contract registry (employment, service, vendor, lease, partnership) with parties,
  lines, milestones and documents; and human-resources structure — departments,
  positions, employment records, assignments, time-off and performance — hung off the
  existing payroll employee master in accounting. Assets, payroll runs and vendors
  already modelled in accounting/billing are referenced, not duplicated.
end note

