note as REC_POLY_ERP_diagram_38_erp
  REC 3.1 — POLYMORPHIC COUNTERPARTIES (no DB-level FK)
  contracts.(counterparty_ref_type,counterparty_ref_id) and
  contract_parties.(party_ref_type,party_ref_id) reference patients, tenants,
  vendors, employees or partners; constrain *_type to a closed value_set and
  validate via trigger. Payroll amounts remain authoritative in accounting.
end note


