note as SAP_ERP_ASSOCIATION_MODEL
  SAP-ALIGNED END-TO-END DOCUMENT FLOW
  Business Partner -> Contract -> Requisition -> Purchase Order -> Goods/Service Receipt
  -> Supplier Bill -> Three-way match -> Payment/Clearing -> Journal/Asset/Liability.
  The same Business Partner may hold customer, supplier, employee, insurer or partner roles.
  Contracts retain versions, clauses, obligations, approvals, amendments, renewals,
  terminations, object assignments, payment schedules and lease accounting links.
end note

